         what='Seven new accounts filed 210 reports on players they had no tie to; a genuine report filed afterwards appeared in neither staff view. Twelve /64 networks of one IPv6 /48 got 60 deletion requests and 240 complaints accepted. Harassment reports, legal complaints and verified account-deletion requests (a 30-day promise) then wait behind junk that staff must close one at a time.',
